    "Independent source-filtered owner merge with composite owner position, exact BigInt ordering, UTF-8 ties, scalar and complete cuts, empty ranges and finite result limits",
    "150-entry five-owner history: 35 payload/order edits, 40 owner transfers, 15 deletions and 20 creates, nine independently filtered requests across each of four snapshots",
    "Cached heads hydrate each candidate once; exact and one-below discovery, setup, candidate, refill, node, batch, read/output byte and physical scan budgets",
