    "Hydration rejects source/key/tenant/model/owner/partition/order/contribution drift and malformed occurrence or incoming reference metadata",
    "Shared raw summary includes hidden contributions while authorized ordered/reverse results disclose only visible records, with no summary or hidden population counters",
    "Protected empty owner roots/incoming ranges and same-snapshot hydration while a payload writer waits",
    "Create/update/delete action scope, admin does not widen owners or grant Use, both-owner transfers and private/managed/reserved-identity restrictions",
    "Added and retargeted scalar/array references check Use and original/proposed/final target owners; fresh generated targets checked after settlement",
    "Final policy effects loaded through the same transaction can reject and roll back authored data, hidden managed repairs, memberships, routes, claims and policy changes",
    "Joint uniqueness/reference repairs, no-op protected reads, caller input detachment and injected commit failure preserve existing atomic guarantees"
